3. AMBER ff14SB force-field parameter values
   Where:     Parameter values transcribed into engine source as constants
              (for example .archive/crates/prism-physics/src/amber_ff14sb.rs,
              crates/prism-gpu/src/amber_mega_fused.rs,
              crates/prism-nhs/src/dstw_dispatch/sidechain_tables.rs).
              No AMBER parameter files (.dat/.frcmod/.lib) are distributed
              here. At run time, topologies are prepared from the user's own
              AmberTools installation.
   Source:    AmberTools 24.8, dat/leap/parm/parm10.dat + dat/leap/parm/frcmod.ff14SB
   Reference: Maier, J. A. et al. "ff14SB: Improving the Accuracy of Protein
              Side Chain and Backbone Parameters from ff99SB."
              J. Chem. Theory Comput. 11, 3696-3713 (2015).
   Terms:     The AmberTools LICENSE states: "The force field parameter files
              in the "../dat/leap" subdirectory have been placed in the public
              domain by their authors."

